WEBVTT

00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:20.970
A coalition is requested by the government army?

00:00:21.140 --> 00:00:26.500
Yes.  It seems like the citizens of the border state, have staged an uprising.

00:00:28.560 --> 00:00:33.300
They have sent in punitive forces a few times, but to no avail.

00:00:33.380 --> 00:00:38.080
So they are resorting to using the Volunteer Army?

00:00:38.520 --> 00:00:41.110
It seems that they have heard about our accomplishments.

00:00:41.240 --> 00:00:45.580
And, asked us to join them if we can pledge our loyalty to the Imperial Court.

00:00:46.110 --> 00:00:50.800
It seems like the people in The Kan Dynasty have noticed our greatness.

00:00:51.280 --> 00:00:56.200
I don't really like working under some wet-behind-the-ears commander, but...

00:00:56.290 --> 00:01:00.320
Let's take this opportunity and kick those lazy Khan Warriors and show them how it is done!

00:01:00.810 --> 00:01:02.470
That will wake them right up.

00:01:02.560 --> 00:01:04.320
Koumei, what do you think?

00:01:04.540 --> 00:01:05.760
Let me see.

00:01:06.160 --> 00:01:12.560
From what I heard, uprisings are happening everywhere.  And the government army is looking for any available help.

00:01:12.780 --> 00:01:18.530
However, they say it's the government army that's going to battle...  It might not be a considerable army.

00:01:18.650 --> 00:01:22.260
So, that's why they're asking for our help.

00:01:22.740 --> 00:01:25.770
Whatever the reason, this is a once in a lifetime opportunity.

00:01:25.950 --> 00:01:30.550
If we show great accomplishment, our name will be known for ever.

00:01:30.730 --> 00:01:36.700
Then more people will enlist with the Volunteer Army, and it will grow and become stronger!

00:01:41.080 --> 00:01:43.930
...In turn we can save more people!

00:01:47.880 --> 00:01:51.830
Then we will set out tomorrow morning.  Everyone, please begin all the necessary preparations.

00:01:51.960 --> 00:01:53.370
Right!

00:02:27.110 --> 00:02:31.320
<i>The moon?  Oh, you are right, it is beautiful.</i>

00:02:31.930 --> 00:02:36.720
<i>But it's no match for your beauty.</i>

00:02:41.020 --> 00:02:45.490
"In turn we can save more people!" he said...

00:02:59.330 --> 00:03:05.060
<b>Kan’u Accomplishes her Goal</b>

00:03:12.740 --> 00:03:16.910
Rin Rin, you should stay in bed, since you're sick.

00:03:18.130 --> 00:03:18.920
Oh, geez.

00:03:19.360 --> 00:03:21.950
I'm not sick!

00:03:22.000 --> 00:03:26.380
You have a fever, you're coughing and your nose is runny. You have a cold!

00:03:26.830 --> 00:03:29.980
Even if I had a fever, cough, and had a runny...

00:03:31.210 --> 00:03:34.850
They say <i>some things</i> don't get sick, so I don't have a cold!

00:03:35.250 --> 00:03:37.130
Some things?  You mean...

00:03:38.010 --> 00:03:45.860
You fool.   Not catching a cold is superstition!  Since fools do catch cold, you do have a cold!

00:03:47.000 --> 00:03:51.870
Koumei, you do have a point, but please do it in a gentler tone.

00:03:52.010 --> 00:03:52.750
But, Kan'u!

00:03:53.190 --> 00:03:56.610
I've always been traveling and fighting by Aisha's side.

00:03:56.700 --> 00:04:01.290
And now Aisha is going to battle without me!  It's unacceptable!

00:04:01.670 --> 00:04:07.240
Rin Rin, I know how you feel, but you can't fight in your condition.

00:04:07.550 --> 00:04:09.500
Yeah, you might become a distraction...

00:04:09.530 --> 00:04:13.700
I said I'm going!  I'm going to fight by Aisha's side!

00:04:15.820 --> 00:04:20.670
See, this happened because you got excited while having a fever. You can't fight like this.

00:04:21.120 --> 00:04:25.020
T... that's not true.  I have to be with Aisha...

00:04:25.050 --> 00:04:26.250
Chōhi Yokutoku,

00:04:27.510 --> 00:04:33.630
I’m giving you a mission.  While we are at war, I need you to stay here and protect the village.

00:04:34.970 --> 00:04:36.260
I will stay behind as well!

00:04:36.980 --> 00:04:40.850
I will prepare supplies just in case the war prolongs!

00:04:40.950 --> 00:04:43.820
I will also help protect the village with Rin Rin.

00:04:44.060 --> 00:04:44.810
Koumei.

00:04:45.190 --> 00:04:48.230
I will personally tell Ryuubi.

00:04:48.370 --> 00:04:51.240
Isn’t protecting the village too difficult for Chōhi?

00:04:51.310 --> 00:04:53.220
Bachō, you keep quiet!

00:04:53.430 --> 00:04:55.310
So, can I trust you to keep the fort safe?

00:04:58.380 --> 00:04:59.650
Of course.

00:04:59.790 --> 00:05:03.270
I will stay behind and protect the village, if you say so.

00:05:05.960 --> 00:05:09.460
Great. That’s what I expect from my little sister.  I’ll leave the village to you.

00:05:11.100 --> 00:05:11.920
I understand!

00:05:13.190 --> 00:05:14.310
Get well soon.

00:05:17.460 --> 00:05:17.900
Yes.

00:05:20.160 --> 00:05:20.840
Rin Rin!

00:05:22.490 --> 00:05:26.860
It can’t be helped.  We have to go to battle without Chōhi and Koumei.

00:05:27.030 --> 00:05:28.330
I am sorry…

00:05:39.030 --> 00:05:40.570
What’s wrong, Kan’u?

00:05:41.120 --> 00:05:43.310
It’s nothing.

00:05:45.250 --> 00:05:47.200
Huh, are they going on an expedition?

00:05:48.910 --> 00:05:50.720
It’s seems like everyone is here.

00:05:51.170 --> 00:05:54.450
Let’s begin the military strategic meeting.  Sōsō.

00:05:55.750 --> 00:05:56.370
Yes.

00:05:56.910 --> 00:06:00.160
The rebel army is barricaded in the mountain which acts as a natural fort.

00:06:00.260 --> 00:06:04.500
A frontal assault will only cause meaningless casualties.

00:06:04.910 --> 00:06:09.630
We should surround the mountain and stop incoming traffic to deprive them of their supplies.

00:06:10.760 --> 00:06:15.240
I hear the uprising started  in the first place because of harsh and unjust taxes.

00:06:15.680 --> 00:06:18.140
Lack of supplies will lower their morale.

00:06:18.420 --> 00:06:23.650
We will admit to our policies' mistakes…  And let them know, if they surrender, their punishment will be reduced.

00:06:23.780 --> 00:06:25.900
I believe this will encourage most of them to come out of the mountain.

00:06:26.620 --> 00:06:30.550
If this goes well, we might be able to stop the uprising without bloodshed.

00:06:30.690 --> 00:06:31.720
It’s too merciful!

00:06:32.470 --> 00:06:33.800
What do you mean it's too merciful?

00:06:34.280 --> 00:06:39.370
To forgive the crimes of those who revolt against the Imperial Court is too merciful.

00:06:39.540 --> 00:06:43.240
And the longer we take to act.  It will be a loss of dignity for the Imperial Court.

00:06:43.370 --> 00:06:46.790
Don’t be soft by just cutting supplies.  Strike them down with one blow!

00:06:47.170 --> 00:06:49.770
But striking them with a frontal attack is reckless!

00:06:50.140 --> 00:06:53.050
An army of bandits is just a disorderly mob.

00:06:53.190 --> 00:06:56.740
If we kill the leader, the others will give up.

00:06:57.250 --> 00:07:00.540
So, is there anyone who would like to volunteer to lead tomorrow’s battle…

00:07:00.640 --> 00:07:04.130
And bring back the head of the enemy leader?

00:07:06.960 --> 00:07:10.110
This is a once-a-in-a-lifetime chance to attain fame.

00:07:11.030 --> 00:07:11.780
My Lord.

00:07:12.710 --> 00:07:16.120
Will you allow me, Ryuubi, to undertake the mission?

00:07:16.600 --> 00:07:19.130
If I remember correctly, you are from the Volunteer Army?

00:07:19.440 --> 00:07:23.610
I, Ryuubi Gentoku, will pledge body and soul to the Imperial Court.

00:07:23.820 --> 00:07:27.130
No matter the number of enemy soldiers trying to take down the Imperial Court…

00:07:27.820 --> 00:07:30.070
I fear nothing.

00:07:30.420 --> 00:07:34.550
Well said.  I order you to take command of tomorrow’s battle.

00:07:35.030 --> 00:07:40.480
I will meet your expectation, and bring back the head of the rebel army leader.

00:07:40.910 --> 00:07:41.700
All right.

00:07:47.410 --> 00:07:50.380
When you bring me back his head…

00:07:50.760 --> 00:07:55.440
I shall hire you as a commander in the government army and have you work as my subordinate.

00:07:56.530 --> 00:07:57.900
I expect good news.

00:07:58.040 --> 00:07:59.130
Yes, general.

00:08:09.530 --> 00:08:13.630
Brother.  I’m starting to see a way to change the world.

00:08:13.830 --> 00:08:16.160
Please, watch over me.

00:08:20.330 --> 00:08:22.620
<i>Have you work as my subordinate.</i>

00:08:25.010 --> 00:08:28.060
Kan’u. Let’s begin our meeting to plan for tomorrow’s battle.

00:08:28.160 --> 00:08:29.150
What’s wrong?

00:08:29.290 --> 00:08:31.170
There’s nothing wrong.

00:08:33.010 --> 00:08:33.730
Kan’u.

00:08:34.040 --> 00:08:34.550
Yes.

00:08:35.060 --> 00:08:37.590
You are my only hope.

00:08:38.480 --> 00:08:41.050
You will always be by my side.

00:08:48.910 --> 00:08:51.000
A proof of my promise…

00:08:51.510 --> 00:08:54.000
Ryuubi.  Umm...

00:08:54.650 --> 00:08:55.640
Now…

00:09:00.670 --> 00:09:01.970
Ryuubi.

00:09:10.140 --> 00:09:11.540
Please drink this.

00:09:12.090 --> 00:09:14.210
Koumei, what’s this?

00:09:14.240 --> 00:09:19.130
It’s brewed Three-day plant, very effective at breaking a fever.

00:09:19.170 --> 00:09:21.010
It smells funny!

00:09:21.420 --> 00:09:25.520
Since it grew when it sucked out whatever life was left in Bachō…

00:09:25.870 --> 00:09:28.260
You will be haunted if you don’t thankfully drink it.

00:09:33.050 --> 00:09:36.530
Disgusting!  One more glass.

00:09:36.740 --> 00:09:37.630
Yes!

00:09:38.790 --> 00:09:39.750
Bosses…

00:09:40.400 --> 00:09:46.210
I went to double check…  It seems the Volunteer Army has really set out on an expedition.

00:09:46.210 --> 00:09:50.000
I see.  The only ones left are the watchmen and the villagers.

00:09:51.200 --> 00:09:52.980
It looks like my chance has finally come.

00:09:56.810 --> 00:09:59.340
Keeping a close eye on the village has paid off.

00:10:01.970 --> 00:10:05.800
Yes, tonight I will take my revenge for the last time.

00:10:07.100 --> 00:10:08.460
<i>You’re a bit too late.</i>

00:10:09.010 --> 00:10:11.990
<i>This fortress is in the hands of the Volunteer Army now.</i>

00:10:12.530 --> 00:10:17.460
It’s their turn to find out that their fort has been taken over, when they come back.

00:10:22.000 --> 00:10:25.430
First, Kan’u, I will have you take over the command of Chōhi’s unit as well.

00:10:25.690 --> 00:10:26.310
Yes.

00:10:26.620 --> 00:10:28.260
- Those two units will be in the front.

00:10:27.810 --> 00:10:29.220
- What are you grinning at?

00:10:28.330 --> 00:10:29.660
- Bachō’s unit will be attacking from the back.

00:10:29.250 --> 00:10:30.280
- Nothing.

00:10:30.240 --> 00:10:31.510
- You are weird.

00:10:30.570 --> 00:10:32.340
- Our main unit will be the reinforcement.

00:10:31.710 --> 00:10:32.340
- Captain!

00:10:33.280 --> 00:10:34.210
What’s wrong?

00:10:34.280 --> 00:10:37.970
The Touka village was attacked by bandits!

00:10:39.810 --> 00:10:40.430
What?

00:10:41.040 --> 00:10:45.320
A messenger just arrived from the village.  Their number is quite large.

00:10:45.420 --> 00:10:51.200
It seems all the defeated bandits have teamed up and attacked the village.

00:10:51.680 --> 00:10:52.700
Damn it!

00:10:53.730 --> 00:10:54.410
And?

00:10:54.750 --> 00:10:59.370
Koumei has taken command.  She has amassed all of the villagers in the chief’s mansion.

00:10:59.470 --> 00:11:02.620
She is working on a defensive plan, she doesn’t know how long they can last and is asking for reinforcements.

00:11:03.160 --> 00:11:04.090
Oh, no.

00:11:04.570 --> 00:11:05.490
Ryuubi.

00:11:06.070 --> 00:11:08.530
What are you doing?  Let’s hurry back to the village.

00:11:09.730 --> 00:11:11.540
No, we are not returning!

00:11:12.050 --> 00:11:16.870
What?  What are you saying?  We have to hurry, while we are doing this, the village is…

00:11:17.590 --> 00:11:21.830
It’s alright. They should be safe with the moats and watchtowers.  Koumei will surely…

00:11:21.900 --> 00:11:22.690
Let me through!

00:11:23.330 --> 00:11:28.500
The bandits have crossed the outer moats of the village!  We need reinforcement right away!

00:11:28.740 --> 00:11:33.730
Hang in there!  We will treat you immediately.  Hey, someone help me to carry him!

00:11:43.160 --> 00:11:46.340
Ryuubi, please send reinforcements to the village!

00:11:46.480 --> 00:11:49.390
But we accepted the mission to lead tomorrow’s battle.

00:11:49.450 --> 00:11:49.970
But...!

00:11:50.510 --> 00:11:53.970
If we succeed in tomorrow’s fight, I will become a commander in the government army!

00:11:54.240 --> 00:11:57.180
Furthermore, I will become a subordinate to the Great General Kashin, a prominent figure.

00:11:58.340 --> 00:12:01.930
But isn’t saving the village more important?

00:12:02.480 --> 00:12:04.800
Losing a base is a hard blow.

00:12:05.150 --> 00:12:08.600
It’s also annoying to think the bandits will loot the collected war funds from the storage.

00:12:08.700 --> 00:12:11.330
That’s not what I’m talking about!

00:12:11.440 --> 00:12:15.570
Please just think what will happen to the villagers if we abandon them.

00:12:16.050 --> 00:12:18.960
Kan’u, I understand your feeling.

00:12:19.300 --> 00:12:25.450
But in order to fix this chaotic world and save our people, we need far greater power.

00:12:26.000 --> 00:12:30.170
In the name of justice, won’t you pledge your loyalty to me?

00:12:32.970 --> 00:12:37.520
We leave the village in Koumei’s hands, and for our justice…

00:12:38.100 --> 00:12:39.880
I need you by my side.

00:12:41.970 --> 00:12:44.220
Think only about me.

00:12:44.910 --> 00:12:49.280
Think of the village as a lost cause.  Now…

00:12:52.870 --> 00:12:54.410
Nice jab.

00:12:55.130 --> 00:13:00.190
W... wait, no matter how strong you are, going alone is suicide!

00:13:00.220 --> 00:13:01.860
Rather, for justice…

00:13:03.330 --> 00:13:05.830
I don’t know what you consider justice, but…

00:13:06.000 --> 00:13:08.290
I have my own conviction.

00:13:09.040 --> 00:13:13.250
Mine is to protect those who truly deserve to be protected.

00:13:14.000 --> 00:13:15.540
W... wait!

00:13:16.090 --> 00:13:17.250
I am leaving as well.

00:13:23.640 --> 00:13:27.130
Rin Rin, Koumei, please be safe…

00:13:30.170 --> 00:13:33.450
Geez, what’s up with that Ryuubi guy?

00:13:33.590 --> 00:13:37.110
How could someone as skilled as Kan’u, choose someone like him as master?

00:13:38.270 --> 00:13:39.950
What business do you have this late at night!

00:13:40.050 --> 00:13:41.550
Let me see Sōsō.

00:13:41.590 --> 00:13:42.580
Hey!

00:13:42.790 --> 00:13:43.710
Stop it.

00:13:43.850 --> 00:13:46.070
Hey Sōsō.  I have something to ask you, so please listen!

00:13:47.640 --> 00:13:51.020
I see, so what is it that you would like me to do?

00:13:51.710 --> 00:13:57.830
Kan’u got all hot headed and set out alone…  That’s just suicide.

00:13:58.000 --> 00:13:59.740
Lend me some of your men!

00:13:59.850 --> 00:14:00.600
No!

00:14:01.590 --> 00:14:05.430
That’s what she gets for choosing a stupid master.  I don’t have any obligation to save her.

00:14:06.140 --> 00:14:07.400
I beg of you!

00:14:12.670 --> 00:14:15.130
So... please!

00:14:15.950 --> 00:14:23.160
Begging the person you tried to kill, in order to avenge your father?  Bachō, why are you so bent on helping her?

00:14:23.780 --> 00:14:24.600
Because she’s a friend!

00:14:27.200 --> 00:14:28.080
How foolish!

00:14:28.560 --> 00:14:29.250
Lord Karin!

00:14:29.280 --> 00:14:30.170
Shunran.

00:14:30.310 --> 00:14:32.900
Take your men and go on a reconnaissance mission.

00:14:34.550 --> 00:14:35.640
Reconnaissance?

00:14:37.660 --> 00:14:41.210
If I encounter any bandits while I am on this mission, what should I do?

00:14:41.280 --> 00:14:45.010
Whatever you deem necessary.  Don’t ask me everything.

00:14:45.420 --> 00:14:46.480
Understood.

00:14:46.680 --> 00:14:47.500
Sōsō.

00:14:49.010 --> 00:14:51.430
What are you waiting for?  Hurry up and leave!

00:14:51.810 --> 00:14:53.140
Yes, right away!

00:14:55.500 --> 00:14:57.000
This is everyone, right?

00:14:57.350 --> 00:14:59.190
We need to strengthen the defenses against the intruders.

00:15:05.350 --> 00:15:09.620
Put helping the wounded as a top priority.  After that, reinforce the west tower.

00:15:09.660 --> 00:15:10.920
I’m going.

00:15:12.150 --> 00:15:15.500
Rin Rin!  You can’t fight in your condition.

00:15:16.080 --> 00:15:19.430
I can’t stay in bed when things are like this.

00:15:19.470 --> 00:15:20.080
But...

00:15:20.080 --> 00:15:25.690
Aisha asked me to protect this village, while she’s away.
So, I will protect this village no matter what!

00:15:26.480 --> 00:15:30.000
I will watch the peach blossoms with the village kids.

00:15:30.440 --> 00:15:31.130
Rin Rin...

00:15:32.080 --> 00:15:34.100
Shuri, I leave the rest to you.

00:15:35.470 --> 00:15:37.550
I understand.

00:15:40.250 --> 00:15:42.990
We only have the mansion left. Strike at once!

00:15:44.800 --> 00:15:46.070
Alright!

00:15:51.370 --> 00:15:52.730
I’m not letting you through!

00:15:52.970 --> 00:15:54.750
You’re not going to get through!

00:15:58.200 --> 00:16:02.410
From here on I, Chōhi Yokutoku, will not let you through.

00:16:02.480 --> 00:16:05.280
Those of you with a death wish come and get me!

00:16:05.620 --> 00:16:07.810
That’s Chōhi of En.

00:16:07.950 --> 00:16:11.300
What are you waiting for?  She’s alone.  Get her!

00:16:11.500 --> 00:16:12.530
Damn you!

00:16:15.260 --> 00:16:17.210
Go!  Go!  Attack!

00:16:19.020 --> 00:16:22.130
<i>I can’t control my body because of the fever...</i>

00:16:22.300 --> 00:16:26.240
<i>But I can’t lose; I have to keep my promise to Aisha.</i>

00:16:26.340 --> 00:16:31.600
<i>The village… the village, I have to… At all cost…  My promise to Aisha…</i>

00:16:34.990 --> 00:16:36.530
Your head is mine!

00:16:46.750 --> 00:16:47.500
Aisha!

00:16:51.330 --> 00:16:53.350
Rin Rin, you did great.

00:16:59.120 --> 00:17:00.800
For what you did to my little sister…

00:17:01.590 --> 00:17:05.280
You’ll pay 10 times... no, a hundred times!

00:17:05.620 --> 00:17:07.770
Even the black hair bandit hunter is here!

00:17:07.880 --> 00:17:10.750
Damn it, get the archers.  Hit them with arrows from afar.

00:17:11.060 --> 00:17:12.320
Go ahead, fire!

00:17:15.710 --> 00:17:18.130
I, Kouchuu, will be your archery opponent.

00:17:18.370 --> 00:17:21.070
Oh, Kouchuu.  Why are you here?

00:17:21.450 --> 00:17:24.050
We will talk later.  Protect the mansion!

00:17:24.420 --> 00:17:26.610
The mansion hasn’t fallen yet?

00:17:26.610 --> 00:17:29.000
Even though we have most of the village under our control…

00:17:29.040 --> 00:17:30.000
Enemy attack!

00:17:30.540 --> 00:17:33.520
The daughter of Batō of Seiryou, Bachō is here!

00:17:33.820 --> 00:17:36.560
Everyone, show them what you’re made of!

00:17:36.590 --> 00:17:36.970
Yes!

00:17:37.450 --> 00:17:38.710
The noble Bachō!

00:17:38.820 --> 00:17:39.940
The Black Troopers!

00:17:40.250 --> 00:17:42.030
What?  Where the heck did Sōsō’s army come from?

00:17:42.130 --> 00:17:44.080
There are about 30 soldiers on horseback!

00:17:44.120 --> 00:17:45.140
Bandits!

00:17:46.270 --> 00:17:48.800
It seems like it's payback time.

00:17:49.040 --> 00:17:50.170
Who are you?

00:17:50.680 --> 00:17:53.590
Sometimes, I am the menma-loving traveling martial artist!

00:17:53.760 --> 00:17:57.350
Other times, I am the messenger of justice and beauty, Butterfly Mask.

00:17:57.450 --> 00:17:59.120
And my true identity is…

00:17:59.430 --> 00:18:01.310
Sei, you came!

00:18:01.380 --> 00:18:01.820
Sei?

00:18:03.430 --> 00:18:06.950
Other times, I am the messenger of justice and beauty, Butterfly Mask.

00:18:07.160 --> 00:18:09.240
And my true identity is…

00:18:11.230 --> 00:18:13.720
Chōun Shiryū of Jouzan is here!

00:18:20.490 --> 00:18:24.050
How can she run through all these guys alone?!

00:18:26.410 --> 00:18:29.070
They’re coming one after another to get in our way.

00:18:29.310 --> 00:18:32.010
Kill them all!

00:18:32.660 --> 00:18:35.700
Sei, you’re the only person I trust to cover my back.

00:18:35.810 --> 00:18:37.650
Right back at you.

00:18:39.570 --> 00:18:44.420
We will move to counter attack stage.  Those who can fight find a partner and fight a single enemy.

00:18:47.260 --> 00:18:48.830
Keep it up, mommy.

00:18:50.680 --> 00:18:56.280
Bandits who only know how to take…  Receive arrows from a hand that knows how to protect!

00:18:56.700 --> 00:19:00.760
I’m really on fire now!  Those who want to burn come and play with my fire!

00:19:02.340 --> 00:19:06.030
Alright!  I won’t be losing here.

00:19:09.380 --> 00:19:12.930
Our leader.  He’s beaten.  Let’s get out of here.

00:19:14.030 --> 00:19:15.600
They’re too strong!

00:19:17.790 --> 00:19:19.020
Too bad!

00:19:19.050 --> 00:19:21.410
Rin Rin how’s your cold?

00:19:21.990 --> 00:19:24.350
It seems all better after a little workout.

00:19:24.560 --> 00:19:26.810
What?  All better?

00:19:26.950 --> 00:19:29.750
Geez, why you little...

00:19:35.260 --> 00:19:37.930
Thank you very much, Kakou Ton.

00:19:38.060 --> 00:19:39.400
You were a great help.

00:19:39.430 --> 00:19:42.300
I will come and personally thank Lord Sōsō.

00:19:42.680 --> 00:19:47.570
I think you probably shouldn’t do that.
You might find yourself in her bed again.

00:19:48.930 --> 00:19:49.930
We will be withdrawing now.

00:19:49.990 --> 00:19:50.640
Yes!

00:19:51.360 --> 00:19:53.510
I thank you as well, Kouchou.

00:19:54.060 --> 00:19:57.790
Oh no, I am happy I could repay you a little bit.

00:19:58.270 --> 00:20:02.030
By the way, why did Sei become some kind of Butterfly Mask thing?

00:20:02.100 --> 00:20:09.340
Well, after I got separated from you two…
I was hit in the head by a shining ball and died.

00:20:09.450 --> 00:20:10.230
WHHAATT?

00:20:10.750 --> 00:20:14.780
The shinning ball was some angel from heaven.

00:20:15.260 --> 00:20:20.220
<i>It seems I have done something wrong.
As an apology, I bestow my power upon you.</i>

00:20:20.900 --> 00:20:26.610
<i>I am going to become one with you.
And work for dominance of this world.</i>

00:20:26.710 --> 00:20:32.900
After that I woke up as a new person.  I found this mask next to me.

00:20:33.480 --> 00:20:39.360
Ever since then, I put on this mask and fight for justice, as Butterfly Mask.

00:20:39.800 --> 00:20:41.210
How strange.

00:20:41.340 --> 00:20:43.670
Chōun are you telling the truth?

00:20:43.740 --> 00:20:44.860
No, I just made it all up.

00:20:46.470 --> 00:20:48.860
You’ll never change, Sei.

00:20:50.030 --> 00:20:56.150
<i>It was three days later that the Volunteer Army led by Ryuubi returned to the village.</i>

00:20:57.410 --> 00:21:03.530
<i>Because it was an impossible plan to begin with…
And it had no chance of winning without Kan’u and Bachō.</i>

00:21:03.840 --> 00:21:05.680
<i>Ryuubi was miserably defeated.</i>

00:21:05.750 --> 00:21:11.020
<i>General Kashin extremely reprimanded him for staining the honor of Imperial Court.</i>

00:21:12.110 --> 00:21:17.960
<i>In the end Sōsō’s strategy suppressed the uprising.</i>

00:21:18.130 --> 00:21:20.730
<i>But that’s a tale of its own.</i>

00:21:21.510 --> 00:21:24.730
H... hey!  I am happy to see, you all are safe and sound.

00:21:25.510 --> 00:21:30.780
Thank you all for coming to greet me out here.  Oh, even new faces I haven’t seen before.

00:21:31.970 --> 00:21:34.710
What, Kouchuu, why are you here?

00:21:35.150 --> 00:21:36.970
Why is it that you know my name?

00:21:37.680 --> 00:21:39.150
That sword, I’ve seen it somewhere before…

00:21:42.440 --> 00:21:44.590
Oh!  He’s a bad guy!

00:21:44.970 --> 00:21:45.720
What?

00:21:45.720 --> 00:21:48.150
That man is...

00:21:48.490 --> 00:21:49.580
Oh! Crap!

00:21:49.820 --> 00:21:51.390
Then…

00:21:52.660 --> 00:21:54.330
I'm out of here.

00:21:55.090 --> 00:21:56.560
Hey, wait up!

00:21:56.970 --> 00:21:59.220
Kouchuu, what’s the matter?

00:21:59.360 --> 00:22:02.030
And why did that Ryuubi guy run away?

00:22:02.440 --> 00:22:09.270
Kan’u, he’s the one who kidnapped Riri and forced me into assassinating the Lord’s son.

00:22:11.020 --> 00:22:13.920
He probably couldn’t support himself with petty crimes.

00:22:14.230 --> 00:22:17.380
So he took advantage of these chaotic times to make a name for himself.

00:22:17.920 --> 00:22:23.770
His tales of nobility and being a descendent of Prince Jing of Zhongshan are all lies.

00:22:24.180 --> 00:22:27.430
Good thing a scoundrel like him wasn’t your first!

00:22:27.560 --> 00:22:29.920
Y... you were watching?!

00:22:29.920 --> 00:22:32.730
You pushed him away at the last minute.

00:22:33.270 --> 00:22:35.630
What?  What is this all about?

00:22:35.630 --> 00:22:36.690
I want to know.

00:22:37.070 --> 00:22:40.660
Everyone, we are ready to watch the blossoms!

00:22:40.860 --> 00:22:47.360
<i>If I am to devote my life to someone,
I will surpass my limitation.</i>

00:22:47.460 --> 00:22:52.490
<i>Now and here,
I will become my own strength.</i>

00:22:52.550 --> 00:22:56.900
<i>And I will march toward the future.</i>

00:22:59.670 --> 00:23:05.890
<i>There are places I like to forget.
There are memories I like to forget.</i>

00:23:06.020 --> 00:23:12.210
<i>I can’t get rid of this swirling hesitation…
and my pride is wounded.</i>

00:23:12.280 --> 00:23:18.500
<i>The light is covered in dust,
if you see through the darkness...</i>

00:23:18.610 --> 00:23:24.550
<i>You can find your path to the new door.</i>

00:23:24.900 --> 00:23:31.050
<i>Beautiful sword dances like the wind.</i>

00:23:31.430 --> 00:23:38.130
<i>Fate so strong, it creates miracles in my life.</i>

00:23:38.160 --> 00:23:40.620
<i>Flower of Bravery.</i>

00:23:40.790 --> 00:23:47.320
<i>Looking only for the truth.
I noticed you were there beside me.</i>

00:23:47.430 --> 00:23:53.200
<i>Your special soul will be our bond.</i>

00:23:53.310 --> 00:23:59.560
<i>A sadness I can’t break free reflects in the depths of my memory.</i>

00:24:00.010 --> 00:24:05.130
<i>Now and here, my sadness will be my strength.</i>

00:24:05.200 --> 00:24:07.560
<i>And I will march toward the future.</i>

00:24:17.920 --> 00:24:22.330
Aisha, we will be together forever…

00:24:22.430 --> 00:24:23.900
Of course, Rin Rin.

00:24:24.040 --> 00:24:27.490
After all, you are my sister.

00:24:28.590 --> 00:24:33.480
<i>In the fully blossomed peach garden.
Kan’u and Chōhi renewed their vow of sisterhood.</i>

00:24:34.600 --> 00:24:41.340
<i>And in the path of these peerless princesses…  What will await?</i>

00:24:42.090 --> 00:24:45.610
<i>Those tales will be told another time, in another place.</i>
